direction: down
research: Research (fan-out)
write: Writer
review: Critic (fresh context)
gate: Router (rule, not LLM)
human: Human approval
publish: Publish (plain code)
ckpt: Checkpointer
research -> write: notes
write -> review: draft
review -> gate: verdict
gate -> write: rejected, rounds < 3
gate -> human: approved
human -> publish: resume
write -> ckpt: save state
